~ Envirionmental setting (for KEKCC users) ~
 This simulation code is confirmed to work with 
   * gcc8.3.0.
   * root-6.22.02
   * Geant4-10.6.2-mt
  So, please set up your bashrc as follows and use 'cmake3' for this Geant4 version.
-------------------
module load gcc/830
source /group/had/sks/software/root/6.22.02/bin/thisroot.sh
source /sw/packages/geant4/10.6.2-mt/bin/geant4.sh
source /sw/packages/geant4/10.6.2-mt/share/Geant4-10.6.2/geant4make/geant4make.sh
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
##### written by tharda on 2022.06.17

(-1) copy CMakeLists.txt.org to CMakeLists.txt.
    $ cp CMakeLists.txt.org CMakeLists.txt

(0) Modify the cmake file, CMakeLists.txt.
    * ROOT_INCLUDE_DIR
      This should be a result of "$ root-config --incdir"
      	   
    * ROOT_LIBRARIES
      This should be a result of "$ root-config --libs"

    * CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX
      This should a location of your simulator


(1) Compile the source codes: 
    $ cd build/
    $ cmake3 ..
    $ make -j4


(2) Execute your simulation: 
    $ cd run/
    $ S2S (macro file) (configuration file)

    | example-->                            |
    | $ ./S2S macro/run.mac conf/param.conf |


(3) A ROOT file will be output to a location
    which you specify in the configuration file.

    |example-->                             |
    | "analysis/root/***.root"              |


(4) Check simulation data:
    $ root analysis/root/XXXX.root
    $ tree->Draw("p0");
    $ tree->Draw("p0","TOFTrig","same");